{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanctum Protocol: Demo</strong><br>Step into a dark world of science fiction and mysticism. You play as the Guardian, a young man bound to an uncertain fate: will you be divine salvation or the seed of corruption?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you <strong>play up to Day 1</strong>, exploring the Sanctuary, meeting the nuns, and making your first choices that influence your purity or corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete first day of the playable story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduction to the corruption/purification system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, provocative anime-inspired visuals.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965390?t=1756960251","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965390?t=1756960251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965390/a69465cd984b46f03188aaff47da583ed7d102eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756960251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965390/a69465cd984b46f03188aaff47da583ed7d102eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756960251","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Sanctum Protocol is an adult visual novel featuring explicit sexual content and moderate violence. It includes erotic scenes with female characters, consensual romantic and sexual interactions within the narrative, as well as themes of corruption, manipulation, and moral dilemmas. The story also explores sensitive topics such as religious fanaticism, spiritual corruption, and ethically complex decisions. No